{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260209010544a657e7abdabc47b5","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create a unique aesthetic for Royal Face. Looking at the palettes already used:\n- Rose & Gold\n- Sage & Pearl  \n- Lavender & Mocha\n- Emerald & Silk\n- Rose & Quartz\n- Amber & Bronze\n- Plum & Gold\n- Sapphire & Champagne\n- Pearl & Mink\n- Opal & Dusty Rose\n- Coral & Seafoam\n\nFor Royal Face, I'll create a **Regal Burgundy & Gold Noir** aesthetic - perfect for a clinic with \"Royal\" in its name. This palette will feature deep burgundy wines, warm gold accents, and cream backgrounds for a luxurious, royal feeling.\n\n**Design Decision:**\n- **Palette**: Regal Burgundy & Gold Noir - deep burgundy (#7B2A3E), warm gold (#C9A86C), cream (#FAF7F2), burgundy-black (#1A1518)\n- **Typography**: Crimson Pro (display) + Manrope (body) - elegant and sophisticated\n- **Border Radius**: Crown-shaped patterns for royal aesthetic"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5a505abb-2913-4760-bc45-7677de2141d5","uuid":"2c3da78c-ff79-4ed5-8f40-e6aa79e076c3"}
